## Maintain Wiki
    ---
    Last run: YYYY-MM-DD
    Tags:
    ---

If any changes have been made to the wiki since the last run date, then:

1. Check that all sources have a summary page. If not make one according to `schema/Ingest Source.md`
2. Ensure all wiki pages are up to date with all related information from every available source. Except design and parameters pages which should only include information from one source.
3. Make sure all wiki pages have correct and up to date properties according to which type of document they are. See `schema/Ingest Source.md` for the details.
4. Make sure that all backlinks for all files including images are functional.
5. Remove any old figure captions or links if the matching image is not available.
6. Ensure all figures linked in wiki pages have their matching figure caption and a link to their original source document.
7. Do not edit, delete, or move any files in `sources/`!
8. Ensure `log.md` is up to date and all entries are in chronological order.
9. Ensure `index.md` is up to date.
